ledImg-sc-h3ozu8-0 fWjUGo size-medium wp-image-4784 aligncenter lazy-load-active\" style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/4f/68/27/eef6c719abfbfbc29a29612e05d72a1d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"449\" height=\"400\" /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"page-name\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCông nghệ sấy PTC khí nóng\u003c/strong\u003e \u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"content-detail\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHệ thống sấy tăng cường Hot air Drying giúp sấy khô hoàn hảo chén bát. \u003cstrong\u003eP\u003c/strong\u003eositive \u003cstrong\u003eT\u003c/strong\u003eemperature \u003cstrong\u003eC\u003c/strong\u003eoefficient (hay gọi tắt là PTC) là công nghệ sấy khô mới, thông minh hơn và tiết kiệm năng lượng.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003csource type=\"image/webp\"\u003e\u003c/source\u003e\u003cimg class=\"WebpImg__StyledImg-sc-h3ozu8-0 fWjUGo size-medium wp-image-4783 aligncenter lazy-load-active\" style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/d8/b3/41/06746b59e9011d8320f0f66747bd768f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"401\" height=\"400\" /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTính năng bảo quản Storage\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"content-detail\"\u003eGiúp loại bỏ mùi hôi, nấm mốc và vi khuẩn. Có thể kéo dài 24 tiếng hoặc 72 tiếng tuỳ ý \u003cstrong\u003emáy rửa bát Texgio\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e14 bộ\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eTGFPCM795B \u003c/strong\u003eđược sử dụng như một tủ lưu bát thông minh.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003csource type=\"image/webp\"\u003e\u003c/source\u003e\u003cimg class=\"WebpImg__StyledImg-sc-h3ozu8-0 fWjUGo size-medium wp-image-4782 aligncenter lazy-load-active\" style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/d6/5a/c5/26175703b4c8791490b11f37cb9331fd.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"400\" /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"page-name\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTia UV diệt khuẩn\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"content-detail\"\u003eTia UV tiêu diệt cấu trúc tế bào DNA và RNA, và ngăn cản sự trở lại của siêu vi. Chương trình Rửa diệt khuẩn Hygiene giúp tác dụng khử khuẩn gấp 4 lần.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003csource type=\"image/webp\"\u003e\u003c/source\u003e\u003cimg class=\"WebpImg__StyledImg-sc-h3ozu8-0 fWjUGo size-medium wp-image-4786 aligncenter lazy-load-active\" style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/f8/59/17/7d5646d01074a3a3d59e868aaedec74f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"619\" height=\"400\" /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"page-name\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThiết kế xếp chén bát kiểu châu Á\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"content-detail\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMáy rửa chén bát Texgio\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eTGFPCM795B \u003c/strong\u003edung tích 14 bộ. 2 giàn + 1 giỏ đũa + 1 khay gấp lửng rửa cả bát đĩa, ly cốc, nồi xoong cùng một lúc.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003csource type=\"image/webp\"\u003e\u003c/source\u003e\u003cimg class=\"WebpImg__StyledImg-sc-h3ozu8-0 fWjUGo size-full wp-image-4785 aligncenter lazy-load-active\" style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/ea/b9/7a/05fc5fa495247a1ce22b730ef8effb6d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"page-name\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKích thước lắp âm tủ\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKích thước sản phẩm vừa phải: 600 x 598 x 795 mm (Sâu x Rộng x Cao), chiều cao máy\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c/strong\u003echỉ 775mm sau khi bỏ nắp trần.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u00